{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"154732","self":"https://jira.hl7.org/rest/api/2/issue/154732","key":"FHIR-31054","fields":{"summary":"Add clarity on cardinality of sliced element","customfield_10618":"Will reword \"Each slice cannot have a greater cardinality than the maximum number of slices allowed\" to\r\n\r\n\"The maximum cardinality on each slice cannot exceed n\"\r\n\r\nWill add\r\n\r\n\"The sum of the minimum cardinalities of the slices SHOULD be less than or equal to m.  The cardinality of the sum of the slice minimums must be met as well as the minimum on the base element.\"\r\n\r\nWill add a warning to the validator if the above SHOULD is violated.","description":"Add to [http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/profiling.html#slice-cardinality:]\r\n * The sum of the minimum cardinalities must be less or equal to **`m` and** `n`\r\n\r\nClarify the first bullet point to:\r\n * Each slice's maximum cardinality cannot be larger than `n`\r\n\r\n_Reported from Zulip topic [Extension element cardinality|https://chat.fhir.org/#narrow/stream/179177/topic/Extension%20element%20cardinality/near/1613053140] with Firely Bot._\r\n ","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://jira.hl7.org/rest/api/2/issue/154732/comment/186020","id":"186020","author":{"self":"https://jira.hl7.org/rest/api/2/user?username=lloyd","name":"lloyd","key":"mckenzie","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.hl7.org/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10351","24x24":"https://jira.hl7.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10351","16x16":"https://jira.hl7.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10351","32x32":"https://jira.hl7.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10351"},"displayName":"Lloyd McKenzie","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Edmonton"},"body":"Moved this to ChangeRequest as needs discussion.  While it *should* be <= m, I'm not sure that's a SHALL.  It's just less confusing if that's the case.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.hl7.org/res